      "code": "def gcd_sub(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n    a = abs(a)\n    b = abs(b)\n    if a == 0:\n        return b\n    if b == 0:\n        return a\n    while a != b:\n        if a > b:\n            a = a - b\n        else:\n            b = b - a\n    return a\n",
